      "prompt": "Thống kê số thẻ vàng của mỗi câu lạc bộ trong giải ngoại hạng Anh mùa giải <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2021</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2022</mn></mrow></semantics></math> cho kết quả như sau:\n\t\n\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>109</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>89</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>85</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>83</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>81</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>80</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>79</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>75</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>74</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>73</mn></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>72</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>71</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>70</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>69</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>65</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>63</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>61</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>60</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>59</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>49</mn></semantics></math></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n\tHãy ghép nhóm dãy số liệu trên thành các nhóm có độ dài bằng nhau với nhóm đầu tiên là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>47</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>57</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Tìm khoảng tứ phân vị của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm.",
